			"gloss": "<i>‘Ayin</i>, the sixteenth letter of the Alphabet. It interchanges with <cite ref=\"A00000\"><he>א</he></cite>, and <cite ref=\"H00000\"><he>ח</he></cite>, v. letters <cite ref=\"A00000\"><he>א</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"H00000\"><he>ח</he></cite>; also with <cite ref=\"F00000\"><he>ו</he></cite>, v. letter <cite ref=\"F00000\"><he>ו</he></cite>; dialectically with <cite ref=\"R00000\"><he>צ</he></cite>, e.g. <cite ref=\"R00010\"><he>צֹאן</he></cite> and <cite ref=\"P00004\"><he>עָאן</he></cite>; with <cite ref=\"S00000\"><he>ק</he></cite>, e.g. <cite ref=\"A03221\"><he>אַרְעָא</he></cite> a. <cite ref=\"A03233\"><he>אַרְקָא</he></cite>.—<cite ref=\"P00000\"><he>ע</he></cite> elided, e.g. <cite ref=\"I00185\"><he>טוּנָא</he></cite> = <cite ref=\"I00194\"><he>טוּעֲנָא</he></cite>; <he>מַדַּנִּים</he> = <cite ref=\"M02067\"><he>מַעֲדַנִּים</he></cite>.—V. <he>עי״ין</he>.",
